{"kind":"table","sheet":"Template","address":"A1:E27","rows":27,"cols":5,"values":[["It is recommended that you do not edit rubrics in spreadsheet format",null,null,null,null],["v1.0-s",null,null,null,null],["Assigned expo role",null,null,null,null],["Completes the individual speaking, demonstration, setup, or support role.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Role is complete and independent.","Role is complete with one prompt.","Role is partly complete.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Five-point explanation",null,null,null,null],["Explains problem, goal, own contribution, one test result, and one improvement.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 5 points are accurate.","4 are accurate.","2–3 are usable.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Evidence response",null,null,null,null],["Answers one teacher question using the shared product or log.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Answer cites specific evidence.","Answer is accurate but general.","Answer is partly accurate.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Closure and reflection",null,null,null,null],["Completes cleanup/file return and the fixed individual reflection.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Both are complete and specific.","Both are complete; one detail is general.","Only one is usable.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Readiness and evidence responsibility",null,null,null,null],["4/40: own computer/login or equal school fallback, on-time start, correct filename, and checkable handoff. Documented school failures use the fallback without deduction.",null,null,null,null],[null,4,3,2,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Ready, correctly named evidence is handed in in